{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EXO","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"出埃及记","commonName":"出埃及记","title":"出埃及记","order":2,"numberOfChapters":40,"sha256":"11de8085569de444dbe200dc394663ee2ea45136751a33792f363f2b98b55e6f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EXO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":40,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EXO/40.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1208},"chapter":{"number":15,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["摩西颂赞耶和华"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那时，摩西和以色列人便歌颂耶和华，说：",{"text":"“我要歌颂耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因祂大获全胜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂把战马和骑兵都抛进海中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华是我的力量，我的诗歌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也成了我的拯救；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂是我的上帝，我要赞美祂；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂是我父亲的上帝，我要尊崇祂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华是战士，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂名叫耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂把法老的战车军兵都抛进海中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"法老的强将都葬身于红海，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大水淹没他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们如同石块沉入深海。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，你的右手用大能彰显威荣；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，你的右手击碎仇敌。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你大显威严，击倒那些起来对抗你的人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你大发雷霆，他们便像枯草遇火，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一烧而尽。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的鼻孔一呼气，海水便堆聚起来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"洪涛便堆起水墙，海底深处也都凝固。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敌人说，‘追啊，追上他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"瓜分他们的财物，尽情掳掠他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拔出刀来把他们斩尽杀绝。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你叫风一吹，海水就淹没他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们好像铅块一样沉没在怒海中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，万神之中，谁能像你？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁能像你——威严神圣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可颂可畏，广行神迹？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你伸出右手，大地便吞灭他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你以不变的爱引领你所救赎的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以大能带他们进入你的圣所。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各邦听见这些事就发抖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"非利士人痛苦不堪，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以东的族长惶恐不安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押的英雄瑟瑟发抖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦南的居民胆战心惊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惊骇恐惧笼罩着他们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你臂膀的大能吓得他们僵立如石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到你的子民都安然走过，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到你买赎的子民都安然走过。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要带领他们到你产业的山上安居，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到你为自己所造的住处，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主啊，到你亲手建的圣所。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"“耶和华必做王，直到永永远远。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["法老的军兵车马追到海中，耶和华使海水回流淹没他们，以色列人却踏着干地走在海中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["亚伦的姐姐米利暗先知手拿小鼓，带领众妇女击鼓跳舞，"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["唱和道：“要歌颂耶和华，因祂大获全胜，祂把战马和骑兵都抛进海中。”"]},{"type":"heading","content":["苦水"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["摩西带领以色列人离开红海，来到书珥旷野，走了三天仍然找不到水喝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["到了玛拉，那里的水却是苦的，不能喝。因此那地方叫玛拉",{"noteId":5},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["百姓就埋怨摩西说：“我们喝什么呢？”"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["摩西向耶和华呼求，耶和华就指示他一棵树，他把树扔在水中，水就变甘甜了。耶和华又在玛拉给百姓定下律例和法令，并在那里试验他们，"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["说：“你们若留心听你们上帝耶和华的话，做我视为正的事，听从我的命令，遵守我的一切律例，我就不把降在埃及的疾病加在你们身上，因为我是医治你们的耶和华。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["到了以琳，那里有十二股水泉和七十棵棕树，他们就在水边安营。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":5,"caller":"+","text":"“玛拉”意思是“苦”。","reference":{"chapter":15,"verse":23}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EXO/15.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EXO/16.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EXO/14.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":27}